            "review_text": "Derrick Cheong\nSingapore4 contributions\n0\nA awesome bowl of noodles cook with loves.\nJan 2026 • Friends\nVery good noodles prepare by a 2nd generation chef from Singapore , very fresh ingredients and natural sweets soup the noodles is springy, prawn is fresh and crunchy, good and thick fish maw , a must have noodles when I am in Vietnam HCM , this is my 3rd times here , the prices is slightly high but it is well spend.\nInsider tip:\nPrepare an empty stomach to be there :)\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 17, 2026",
