            "review_title": "Review at Hao Phong mi gia",
            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n1\nUnassuming restaurant, friendly owner, EXCELLENT food.\nMay 2025 • Family\nSitting on a quiet corer of District 5 with plain glass doors and simple interior decor, you probably might not know the awesome food it serves unless you've heard of it via word of mouth or one of the trending videos that showcases its ~usd70 abalone noodles (just one of their many dishes). \n\nFriendly owner Kelvin welcomed us with his crisp menu with clear photos of enticing dishes and honestly everything looked so good. Those who know seafood can tell their ingredients such as abalones, shrimps/prawns, scallops, shark's fins were of such top quality that one usually get to taste them only in five-star hotels/restaurants. Their simple and unassuming springy noodles were a great complement to the seafood.\n\nWe missed Singapore's chilli crab and was happy that we found an authentic and single-claypot-500,000vnd-portion here - so we get to enjoy it without having to order an entire usd100+++ crab in big seafood restaurants. Quite clever to serve the already shelled meat for easier sharing AND once again, quite rare to get such big and juicy crab claws in small restaurants.\n\nOur favourite was the thick, soft, chewy, gelatinous and nutritious fish maw that soaked up the clear and tasty broth - the best way to enjoy the natural sweetness of his ultra-fresh seafood. Met his dad and realized they import/export high quality seafood from North America. Now we know how they ensure a consistent supply of high quality seafood - they run their own supply chain too! \n\nThey're not on Grab platform and they do private dinners too. Best way to get their food is to drop by, or order via phone (they'll arrange delivery).\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
